   "note": "Most misdemeanors can be expunged by petition 5 years after the sentence is finished, if it is your only conviction (or one of two eligible convictions). Listed misdemeanors such as DUI, domestic assault, stalking and several sex offenses can never be expunged; it is a one-time remedy.",
