   "automatic": false,
   "note": "A DUI conviction (Tenn. Code Ann. § 55-10-401) is on Tennessee's list of offenses that can never be expunged.",
   "citation": "Tenn. Code Ann. § 40-32-107(a) exclusion list (formerly § 40-32-101(g)); § 55-10-401",
   "source_url": "https://ccc.nashville.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Expungement-Petition-a.pdf",
